sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Controller as IntentNav Controller
    participant TargetDOM as Webpage Interactive Target
    participant Collector as Witness Collector
    participant Verifier as Causal Transition Verifier

    Note over Controller,TargetDOM: Candidate Selected; Transition Signature Defined
    Controller->>Collector: Register Activation Event (ID: act_101, t0 = 1000ms)
    Controller->>TargetDOM: Dispatch Activation Event (Click / Keydown)
    
    par Multi-Class Witness Generation
        TargetDOM->>Collector: Witness 1: DOM Mutation (t = 1040ms, delta matched)
        TargetDOM->>Collector: Witness 2: Accessibility State Mutation (t = 1080ms, stateChanged)
        TargetDOM->>Collector: Witness 3: Route State / History Mutation (t = 1110ms)
    end

    Controller->>Collector: Retrieve Witnesses for Window [1000ms, 3000ms]
    Collector->>Verifier: Send Activation Event + Witness Log
    
    Note over Verifier: Causality Check:<br/>1. t_witness > t_activation? (YES)<br/>2. t_witness - t_activation <= 2000ms? (YES)<br/>3. Delta matches expectedStateDelta? (YES)<br/>4. >= 2 independent witness classes? (YES: DOM + A11y + History)

    Verifier-->>Controller: CAUSALLY VERIFIED (Promote to ACTIVE_VALIDATED)

